sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Quan tri vien (Admin)
    actor Citizen as Nguoi dan (Map Discovery)
    participant PkgCtrl as ServicePackagesController
    participant RecCtrl as RecyclerDiscoveryController
    participant PkgSvc as ServicePackageService
    participant GeoSvc as GeoMatchingService
    participant EntSvc as SubscriptionEntitlementService
    participant Audit as AuditLogService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL & IMemoryCache

    Note over Admin,DB: A-10 Cau hinh goi + Grandfathering & R-07 Hien thi Tich xanh / Ghim noi bat ban do

    Admin->>PkgCtrl: POST /api/v1/admin/service-packages (UpsertServicePackageRequest)
    PkgCtrl->>PkgSvc: CreatePackageAsync(adminId, request)
    PkgSvc->>DB: Validate duplicate code & INSERT ServicePackage
    PkgSvc->>Audit: LogAsync(CREATE_SERVICE_PACKAGE)
    PkgCtrl-->>Admin: 201 Created (MSG-PAY-07)

    Admin->>PkgCtrl: PUT /api/v1/admin/service-packages/{packageId} (Doi gia moi)
    PkgCtrl->>PkgSvc: UpdatePackageAsync(adminId, packageId, request)
    alt Doi PackageCode cua goi da co ServiceOrder
        PkgSvc-->>PkgCtrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-PAY-05)
        PkgCtrl-->>Admin: 400 BadRequest
    else Cap nhat goi BASIC (Chi doi ten/mo ta, khoa Price=0) hoac goi thuong mai (Grandfathering)
        PkgSvc->>DB: UPDATE ServicePackage (Chi ap dung don moi - Snapshot cu giu nguyen)
        PkgSvc->>Audit: LogAsync(UPDATE_SERVICE_PACKAGE)
        PkgCtrl-->>Admin: 200 OK (MSG-PAY-07)
    end

    Admin->>PkgCtrl: PATCH /api/v1/admin/service-packages/{basicId}/status (isActive=false)
    PkgCtrl->>PkgSvc: TogglePackageStatusAsync(adminId, basicId, false)
    PkgSvc-->>PkgCtrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-PAY-05 - Chan tat goi BASIC)
    PkgCtrl-->>Admin: 400 BadRequest

    Note over Citizen,DB: Phan tang hien thi Co so thu mua theo goi PRO tren ban do (U-05 / R-07)
    Citizen->>RecCtrl: GET /api/v1/recyclers/nearby?lat=...&lng=...&radiusKm=...
    RecCtrl->>GeoSvc: FindNearestPartnersAsync(lat, lng, category, radius)
    GeoSvc->>DB: Query Verified Online RecyclerProfiles + Active Prices
    GeoSvc->>GeoSvc: EnrichPartnerEntitlementsAsync(partners)
    GeoSvc->>EntSvc: GetBatchEntitlementsAsync(recyclerUserIds)
    EntSvc->>DB: Doc IMemoryCache sub_entitlements:{id} hoac Active UserSubscriptions
    EntSvc-->>GeoSvc: Map UserEntitlementSummaryDto (hasVerifiedBlueBadge, isFeaturedMapMarker)
    GeoSvc->>GeoSvc: OrderByDescending(IsFeatured) ThenBy(HasVerifiedBadge) ThenBy(DistanceKm)
    RecCtrl-->>Citizen: 200 OK (Danh sach Recycler uu tien ghim Pro Tich xanh len dau)
